#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:3
#: 7b697b93c283458a8e9b42ab2bad2b87
msgid "关联随机自旋（Correlated Random Spin）"
msgstr "Correlated Random Spin"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:5
#: 51518a99429046de9b9672f7181877bd
msgid "**分类：** 磁性"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:7
#: 858913203ba74904a80fcaa3c4690ce5
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "What the card does"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:9
#: 97dc0579c45b4ac2b8d3f3b620c1b5ee
msgid ""
"`Correlated Random Spin` 从已有磁矩或元素磁矩表出发，生成带空间相关长度的非共"
"线随机磁矩。它保持每个原子的磁矩模长，只改变方向；相关性由距离核函数和 `相关"
"长度`（`correlation_length`）控制。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:11
#: f87b36389cca40a9bbc948781f2ae51a
msgid ""
"这张卡不叫 `Spin Glass`，因为它没有引入交换哈密顿量、frustration 约束或动力学"
"冷却过程。它只表达一个清楚的训练集状态：空间相关的随机非共线自旋场。"
msgstr ""
"This card is deliberately not called `Spin Glass`: it includes no exchange "
"Hamiltonian, frustration constraint, or dynamical cooling. Its precise "
"training-set meaning is a spatially correlated random noncollinear spin "
"field."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:13
#: 668572b00c874c2e8183cfdc79ba1a9c
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr "Principle and equations"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:15
#: ec8e4a9ce173454fad74335ab1fcda86
msgid "程序先按周期最小镜像距离 $r_{ij}$ 构造空间协方差矩阵。两种核分别是"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:17
#: d7afe9f886324e4a8bff376295ae1565
msgid ""
"\n"
"K_{ij}^{\\mathrm{exp}}=\\exp(-r_{ij}/\\xi),\\qquad\n"
"K_{ij}^{\\mathrm{SE}}=\\exp\\!\\left[-\\frac12(r_{ij}/\\xi)^2\\right],\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:22
#: 17f77262ce964466a0f31fde1275140a
msgid ""
"其中 $\\xi$ 是相关长度，单位 Å。对 $K=\\mathbf L\\mathbf L^\\mathsf T$ 做 "
"Cholesky 分解， 再令 $\\mathbf u=\\mathbf L\\mathbf z$，$\\mathbf z$ 为独立标"
"准高斯随机场，于是相邻原子的 随机方向变化彼此相关。`参考方向圆锥`模式只取 $"
"\\mathbf u$ 在原磁矩横向平面内的方向， 并把偏转角限制在圆锥半角内；`完全随机"
"方向`直接归一化相关场。两种模式都保持每个原磁矩 的模长不变。该算法使用完整 "
"$N\\times N$ 协方差矩阵，因此有明确的最大原子数限制。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:28
#: 6c6e03e1afd84359a1154e4092f36d59
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example workflow"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:30
#: d5c87eaed9064d58b6b8daca49cb2a1a
msgid "场景：训练集有 PM 随机态，但缺少有限相关长度的非共线态"
msgstr ""
"Scenario: PM-like random states exist, but finite-range noncollinear "
"correlations are missing"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:32
#: b161ec4776c74c568b4c89bf9815f547
msgid ""
"模型在完全随机 PM 和有序 FM/AFM 上都能跑，但在短程相关的高温磁态上磁力误差明"
"显偏大。用 `Correlated Random Spin` 可以生成相关长度为 3 Angstrom 的非共线扰"
"动，让相邻原子磁矩方向更相近，远距离方向逐渐失相关。"
msgstr ""
"A model handles fully random PM-like states and ordered FM/AFM states but "
"has large magnetic-force error in short-range-correlated high-temperature "
"states. Generate noncollinear fields with a 3 Å correlation length so nearby "
"moments tend to align while distant directions decorrelate."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:34
#: 56ccbb70c15c4500b2e9c77aeaec15ec
msgid ""
"参数设置：`mode=Cone around reference`，`correlation_kernel=exponential`，"
"`correlation_length=3.0`，`samples=5`，`cone_angle=30.0`，"
"`magnitude_source=Existing initial magmoms`，`max_atoms_for_full=200`。"
msgstr ""
"Parameters: `mode=Cone around reference`, `correlation_kernel=exponential`, "
"`correlation_length=3.0`, `samples=5`, `cone_angle=30.0`, "
"`magnitude_source=Existing initial magmoms`, and `max_atoms_for_full=200`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:36
#: d41b6c25f438436fa833b988639f015c
msgid ""
"输出结构的 `spin` 为 `(N, 3)`，`Config_type` 追加 `CorrSpin(...)`。检查时看磁"
"矩模长是否保持、cone 角度是否符合设定，以及不同 `相关长度`"
"（`correlation_length`）下相邻自旋相似度是否变化。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:38
#: e77a0534daf24824ae67fe748941bbb9
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:40
#: 9de710109f1a48bdbe432e600059c0d4
msgid "相关随机场"
msgstr "Correlated random field"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:42
#: 08e65fe11e844d9a8e941375818c123f
msgid "模式（mode）"
msgstr "mode"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:44
#: 4c322f4dd2f84e148fff20cae2424b51
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `'Cone around reference'`。`Cone around reference` 保留有序态的方"
"向，只叠加有限温非共线涨落；`PM-like random field` 不再围绕参考方向，适合补 "
"PM 附近但带空间相关长度的样本。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `'Cone around reference'`. `Cone around reference` retains an "
"ordered reference and adds finite-temperature noncollinear fluctuations. `PM-"
"like random field` is not centered on the reference direction and targets "
"correlated PM-like samples."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:46
#: d74d2f1a2a334c1493422dcd2e452052
msgid "相关核函数（correlation_kernel）"
msgstr "correlation_kernel"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:48
#: 0f90eef162e648c6925da34dd918ded0
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `'exponential'`。自旋空间相关函数。`exponential` 衰减更慢，保留更"
"长尾的自旋关联；`squared_exponential` 更平滑但远距离衰减更快。有限相关长度磁"
"无序优先选 exponential。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `'exponential'`. Spatial correlation kernel. `exponential` "
"has a longer tail; `squared_exponential` is smoother and decays faster. "
"Start with exponential for generic finite-range magnetic disorder."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:50
#: 0a8104f364b843c188e79a72c808898e
msgid "相关长度（correlation_length）"
msgstr "correlation_length"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:52
#: fdb30dba3a824319b2d0e1bdc381245d
msgid ""
"`float`，默认 3.0 Å。自旋随机场的空间相关长度。设得比最近邻距离还小 → 近似独"
"立随机；放大到几倍晶格常数 → 形成平滑磁畴。做有限温磁无序时不要一上来就跳到无"
"限长相关。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default `3.0` Å. Spatial correlation length. Below the nearest-"
"neighbor distance the field approaches independent randomness; several "
"lattice constants create smooth domains. Scan finite values before assuming "
"long-range correlation."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:54
#: ef48c9ec5a1d4fc38ad020888ace10da
msgid "完整协方差最大原子数（max_atoms_for_full）"
msgstr "max_atoms_for_full"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:56
#: 73557580b2cb485295c15232df943cc7
msgid ""
"`int`，默认 200。full covariance 方法能处理的最大原子数，因为需要 O(N³) 的 "
"Cholesky 分解。小体系保持默认即可；超过几百个磁性原子时先缩小结构，不要盲目调"
"大这个值。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default `200`. Maximum atoms for full-covariance sampling, which "
"requires an O(N³) Cholesky factorization. Keep the default for small "
"systems; reduce a system with hundreds of magnetic atoms instead of blindly "
"raising this limit."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:58
#: ebced27d39474c2b9a71d5f950987074
msgid "输出和角度"
msgstr "Outputs and angular range"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:60
#: 4269fd624b504f67a35e18b4b475a889
msgid "样本数（samples）"
msgstr "samples"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:62
#: 825b0a71660d4fb6b087ba9599ed9c9e
msgid ""
"`int`，默认 1。每个相关长度下生成几个随机场样本。1~3 个覆盖趋势，5 个以上才开"
"始给同一相关长度做统计。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default `1`. Random fields per correlation length. One to three trace "
"a trend; five or more begin to sample variability at one length."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:64
#: c8b9a4c30dc54515873956f1b413f60a
msgid "锥角（cone_angle）"
msgstr "cone_angle"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:66
#: 3629bdbadfcc4b81823c9eb137c930bf
msgid ""
"`float`，默认 30.0°。cone 模式下偏离参考方向的最大角度。10~30° 是有序态附近的"
"扰动，60° 以上更接近强非共线无序。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default `30.0` degrees. Maximum deviation from the reference in "
"cone mode. About 10-30 degrees represents fluctuations near order; above 60 "
"degrees approaches strong noncollinear disorder."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:68
#: ce8974fab0234ea8bb9ec1a7745cf983
msgid "生效条件：`模式`（`mode`）为 cone 模式时。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:70
#: c0fab3ce01bd4f0d99f4c4e419d98c73
msgid "磁矩幅值"
msgstr "Moment magnitudes"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:72
#: eeb739051f9d43cbbad8bcd431762cf1
msgid "磁矩大小来源（magnitude_source）"
msgstr "magnitude_source"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:74
#: 6aa0abc4240740f491abe169902b0a21
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `'Existing initial magmoms'`。磁矩幅值的来源。输入有 `spin:R:3` "
"时优先复用，没有时兼容旧 `initial_magmoms`；两者都没有时用 `元素磁矩表`"
"（`magmom_map`）和 `默认磁矩`（`default_moment`）构造。不要用默认幅值替代已知"
"元素的实测磁矩。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:76
#: 448e4ebb893148a5b2bbf56afba22306
msgid "元素磁矩表（magmom_map）"
msgstr "magmom_map"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:78
#: 041f1fb3c0824e5998f10720f168f17a
msgid ""
"`str`，默认空。按元素显式指定磁矩幅值，格式如 `Fe:2.2, Ni:0.6`。已知元素局域"
"磁矩就填进去，未知元素别用默认值伪造先验。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, empty by default. Explicit element magnitudes such as `Fe:2.2, "
"Ni:0.6`. Enter known local moments and avoid inventing priors for unknown "
"species."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:80
#: 1ec72ebaedb74962a376027ab1fb005d
msgid "默认磁矩（default_moment）"
msgstr "default_moment"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:82
#: 31c3ea2a1461442880a5dd5ed0f70d48
msgid ""
"`float`，默认 0.0。作为 `元素磁矩表`（`magmom_map`）没命中的元素的兜底幅值。"
"关键磁性元素应显式列在 magmom_map 里，非磁元素通常保持 0。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:84
#: f6d80c322f404b8eb9f90d8b2f9540eb
msgid "标量磁矩转为矢量（lift_scalar）"
msgstr "lift_scalar"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:86
#: 58063bad77924c0f801de5810e1c681a
msgid ""
"`bool`，默认 true。把标量磁矩提升为非共线向量。输入是标量但下游需要向量时打"
"开；如果原始数据本身已有方向信息，不要重新提升覆盖它。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default `true`. Promote scalar moments to noncollinear vectors when "
"required downstream. Do not overwrite input that already contains directions."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:88
#: 083470cb0fc5471dbc354d416906f4db
msgid "轴（axis）"
msgstr "axis"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:90
#: db8c6d6206184332ba91b50f35892430
msgid ""
"`list[float] | tuple[float, float, float]`，默认 `(0.0, 0.0, 1.0)`。cone 模式"
"下的参考磁矩方向。这不是普通数值——改它会影响分层、表面法向或磁矩取向；使用前"
"先确认 cell 取向和目标物理方向。"
msgstr ""
"`list[float] | tuple[float, float, float]`, default `(0.0, 0.0, 1.0)`. "
"Reference direction in cone mode. Confirm cell orientation and the intended "
"physical direction before changing it."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:92
#: 8c05c94931664ee1a82aa3236b263759
msgid "生效条件：涉及方向、分层、表面或向量初始化的模式。"
msgstr ""
"Used by modes involving a direction, layering, a surface, or vector "
"initialization."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:94
#: bb57a388852d497487479f1880387505
msgid "应用元素（apply_elements）"
msgstr "apply_elements"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:96
#: 8be85f282306475eaee9605340d102b1
msgid ""
"`str`，默认空（全部生效）。逗号分隔限定只处理指定元素。含非磁基底时显式列出 "
"Fe/Co/Ni/Mn 等磁性元素，避免给无关原子写磁矩。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, empty by default (all atoms). A comma-separated restriction to "
"selected elements. In a nonmagnetic host, list magnetic species such as Fe, "
"Co, Ni, or Mn explicitly."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:98
#: 8372b9de9cdc4376b475704a59bdf637
msgid "随机性"
msgstr "Randomness"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:100
#: 70e10eb7beac405da05bd606c7a7bc99
msgid "使用随机种子（use_seed）"
msgstr "use_seed"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:102
#: c1bc80589d1f4d90975a5b45417e85fa
msgid ""
"`bool`，默认 false。需要可复现训练集、测试或对比实验时打开；最终大规模随机探"
"索可以关，但结果不能逐帧复现。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default `false`. Enable for reproducible datasets, tests, or "
"comparisons. Exploratory sampling may disable it, but frames will not be "
"reproducible."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:104
#: 7192b21d0d90463bae85ac5ea20aeda9
msgid "随机种子（seed）"
msgstr "seed"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:106
#: c7f726e72e6f46318735489e73891441
msgid ""
"`int`，默认 0。固定随机种子值。相同输入、相同参数和相同 seed 生成同一批候选；"
"只有 `use_seed=True` 时改它才会改变输出。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default `0`. Fixed seed. Identical input, parameters, and seed "
"produce identical candidates; it is used only when `use_seed=True`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:108
#: c06d2b6acf6f475280c8abb68fbd5fdb
msgid "生效条件：`use_seed=True`。"
msgstr "Active only when `use_seed=True`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:110
#: 08d4e7a4e1d14fe6a5971a1f545eb3cf
msgid "推荐预设"
msgstr "Recommended presets"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:112
#: d80fd5b8ffed4c25bf7bac7d10606858
msgid "有序态附近的有限温扰动"
msgstr "Finite-temperature fluctuations near an ordered state"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/correlated-random-spin-card.md:114
#: cc20bc44b3ce4351a1545582d81cef8a
msgid ""
"{\n"
